        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are in a mysterious place, <strong>Aquariums</strong> and <strong>Liminal Halls</strong> surround you... As you go deeper your mind starts to play tricks, did you see something move inside the tank? Or is it just your <strong>Thalassophobia</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654850/extras/652461163505cc678985fea1ef70ec19.poster.avif?t=1767125398\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654850/extras/652461163505cc678985fea1ef70ec19.webm?t=1767125398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654850/extras/652461163505cc678985fea1ef70ec19.mp4?t=1767125398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you wander <strong>Aquariums</strong>, the more inevitable it becomes — you’ll have to step into the water and face what waits inside the tanks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654850/extras/105d964caa6a2d6dee760b64da123f1f.poster.avif?t=1767125398\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654850/extras/105d964caa6a2d6dee760b64da123f1f.webm?t=1767125398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654850/extras/105d964caa6a2d6dee760b64da123f1f.mp4?t=1767125398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lost in a vast <strong>liminal facility</strong> of strange Aquariums, swimming pools and corridors, you must uncover the truth behind its creation... You will encounter entities like the <strong>Divers</strong> who seem to be in some kind of trance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654850/extras/2293ccfe1987bb38ca38f48751fff399.poster.avif?t=1767125398\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654850/extras/2293ccfe1987bb38ca38f48751fff399.webm?t=1767125398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654850/extras/2293ccfe1987bb38ca38f48751fff399.mp4?t=1767125398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will find sharks, lost divers, gigantic whales and a sense of a horrible past... The creatures you encounter will haunt you and twist your perception of what’s real.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654850/extras/1aa6b68eecdd81a9fa7078b536cf8c19.poster.avif?t=1767125398\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654850/extras/1aa6b68eecdd81a9fa7078b536cf8c19.webm?t=1767125398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654850/extras/1aa6b68eecdd81a9fa7078b536cf8c19.mp4?t=1767125398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AQUARIUMS</strong> has seven unique chapters, each taking 10 to 30 minutes to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>AQUARIUMS</i> draws inspiration from internet phenomena like <strong>liminal spaces, found footage, thalassophobia</strong>, the <strong>Poolrooms</strong>, and the <strong>Backrooms</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created by a solo developer driven by a love for horror games — and a lifelong fear of sharks and deep water.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are in a mysterious place, <strong>Aquariums</strong> and <strong>Liminal Halls</strong> surround you... As you go deeper your mind starts to play tricks, did you see something move inside the tank? Or is it just your <strong>Thalassophobia</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654850/extras/652461163505cc678985fea1ef70ec19.poster.avif?t=1767125398\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654850/extras/652461163505cc678985fea1ef70ec19.webm?t=1767125398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654850/extras/652461163505cc678985fea1ef70ec19.mp4?t=1767125398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you wander <strong>Aquariums</strong>, the more inevitable it becomes — you’ll have to step into the water and face what waits inside the tanks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654850/extras/105d964caa6a2d6dee760b64da123f1f.poster.avif?t=1767125398\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654850/extras/105d964caa6a2d6dee760b64da123f1f.webm?t=1767125398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654850/extras/105d964caa6a2d6dee760b64da123f1f.mp4?t=1767125398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lost in a vast <strong>liminal facility</strong> of strange Aquariums, swimming pools and corridors, you must uncover the truth behind its creation... You will encounter entities like the <strong>Divers</strong> who seem to be in some kind of trance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654850/extras/2293ccfe1987bb38ca38f48751fff399.poster.avif?t=1767125398\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654850/extras/2293ccfe1987bb38ca38f48751fff399.webm?t=1767125398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654850/extras/2293ccfe1987bb38ca38f48751fff399.mp4?t=1767125398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will find sharks, lost divers, gigantic whales and a sense of a horrible past... The creatures you encounter will haunt you and twist your perception of what’s real.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654850/extras/1aa6b68eecdd81a9fa7078b536cf8c19.poster.avif?t=1767125398\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654850/extras/1aa6b68eecdd81a9fa7078b536cf8c19.webm?t=1767125398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654850/extras/1aa6b68eecdd81a9fa7078b536cf8c19.mp4?t=1767125398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AQUARIUMS</strong> has seven unique chapters, each taking 10 to 30 minutes to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>AQUARIUMS</i> draws inspiration from internet phenomena like <strong>liminal spaces, found footage, thalassophobia</strong>, the <strong>Poolrooms</strong>, and the <strong>Backrooms</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created by a solo developer driven by a love for horror games — and a lifelong fear of sharks and deep water.</p>",
